<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has completed all five credit auctions in the secondary market.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM     MAX    MIN    AVG    BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>1.483  bln pesos  8 days   30.30  30.18  30.24    2    2</p>
<p>1.483  bln pesos  6 days   30.27  30.18  30.20    6    4</p>
<p>1.483  bln pesos  5 days   30.19  30.08  30.15    8    4</p>
<p>1.482  bln pesos  4 days   N/A    N/A    30.02    N/A  N/A</p>
<p>2.000  bln pesos  1 day    N/A    N/A    29.81    N/A  N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
